    '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M18 3a3 3 0 00-3 3v12a3 3 0 003 3 3 3 0 003-3 3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3 3 3 0 003 3 3 3 0 003-3V6a3 3 0 00-3-3 3 3 0 00-3 3 3 3 0 003 3h12a3 3 0 003-3 3 3 0 00-3-3z"/></svg>',
